<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY FOUR.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY FOUR.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
